# Public _redirects intentionally empty.
#
# Earlier revisions redirected `/*` to `/.netlify/functions-internal/server`
# to invoke the SSR Function. That triggered Netlify's `excludedPath:
# ["/.netlify/*"]` rule on the Function itself (the rewritten URL matched
# its own exclusion and the Function returned 404).
#
# The modern Nitro preset registers the SSR Function with
# `path: "/*"` and `preferStatic: true`, so Netlify already routes every
# non-asset request to it without a rewrite. Static assets under
# /assets/ are served from `dist/` first via `preferStatic`.
#
# Keep this file present (empty) so Nitro doesn't add its own fallback
# _redirects on top of ours — it short-circuits with "Not adding Nitro
# fallback to _redirects (as an existing fallback was found)".
